msgstr "Trafic entrant"

#. Used in the browser
msgid "Traffic is split between the backends by weight."
msgstr "Le trafic est réparti entre les backends selon leur poids."

#. Used in the browser
msgid "Traffic is split by weight."
msgstr "Le trafic est réparti selon le poids."

