"With TLS on, this route only answers HTTPS, so plain http on {eps} returns "
"404 page not found. Choose No TLS for an http-only route."
msgstr ""

#, python-format
msgid ""
"With mTLS, the cert paths are resolved %(inside_the_agent)s, so mount them "
"there too. A client certificate replaces the API key and machine login."
msgstr ""
"Avec le mTLS, les chemins des certificats sont résolus %(inside_the_agent)s; "
"montez-les donc également à cet emplacement. Un certificat client remplace "
"la clé d’API et la connexion de machine."

